---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="SpaceNews privacy policy: what data we collect (very little) and how it is used."
	eyebrow="Legal"
>
	<p>
		SpaceNews is a static website. We do not run user accounts, comments, newsletters, or
		analytics trackers of our own — so there is very little personal data for us to collect in
		the first place. This policy explains what little is involved when you visit.
	</p>

	<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Contact emails.</strong> If you email us or use the contact form (which opens your
			email app), we receive the name, email address, and message content you choose to send.
			We use it only to respond to you.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider may automatically log basic technical
			information such as IP addresses and requested pages for security and operational
			purposes. We do not use this to identify you.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Cookies</h2>
	<p>
		SpaceNews does not set its own cookies and does not use third-party advertising or analytics
		cookies.
	</p>

	<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Images.</strong> Article photography is served from
			<a href="https://unsplash.com" rel="noopener">Unsplash</a>'s content delivery network.
			Loading an image sends a standard web request to their servers, subject to
			<a href="https://unsplash.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Unsplash's privacy policy</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>External links.</strong> Following a link to another website is subject to that
			site's own privacy practices.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Data Retention & Your Rights</h2>
	<p>
		Emails you send us are kept only as long as needed to handle your inquiry. You may request a
		copy or deletion of any personal information you have sent us by emailing
		<a href="mailto:hello@SpaceNews.biz.id">hello@SpaceNews.biz.id</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
	<p>
		SpaceNews is a general-audience site and does not knowingly collect personal information from
		children under 13.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
	<p>
		If this policy changes, we will post the updated version on this page with a revised date.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about privacy? Reach us at
		<a href="mailto:hello@SpaceNews.biz.id">hello@SpaceNews.biz.id</a>.
	</p>
</Page>
